begin="0:11.830" end="0:12.020">時</span><span begin="0:12.020" end="0:12.460">間</span><span begin="0:12.460" end="0:12.660">が</span></p><p begin="0:12.660" end="0:14.360" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.660" end="0:12.780">も</span><span begin="0:12.780" end="0:13.070">う</span><span begin="0:13.070" end="0:13.500">楽</span><span begin="0:13.500" end="0:13.690">し</span><span begin="0:13.690" end="0:13.950">く</span><span begin="0:13.950" end="0:14.360">て</span></p></div><div begin="0:14.640" end="0:41.620" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="0:14.640" end="0:17.790" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.640" end="0:14.730">水</span><span begin="0:14.730" end="0:14.950">面</span><span begin="0:14.950" end="0:15.340">に</span><span begin="0:15.340" end="0:15.650">映</span><span begin="0:15.650" end="0:15.850">る</span><span begin="0:15.850" end="0:16.510">桜</span><span begin="0:16.510" end="0:17.150">輝</span><span begin="0:17.150" end="0:17.320">く</span><span begin="0:17.320" end="0:17.790">春</span></p><p begin="0:17.950" end="0:21.270" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.950" end="0:18.210">一</span><span begin="0:18.210" end="0:18.430">緒</span><span begin="0:18.430" end="0:18.660">に</span><span begin="0:18.660" end="0:19.030">選</span><span begin="0:19.030" end="0:19.260">んだ</span><span begin="0:19.260" end="0:19.690">水</span><span begin="0:19.690" end="0:19.970">着</span><span begin="0:19.970" end="0:20.130">で</span><span begin="0:20.130" end="0:20.590">遊</span><span begin="0:20.590" end="0:20.800">ぶ</span><span begin="0:20.800" end="0:21.270">夏</span></p><p begin="0:21.420" end="0:22.980" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.420" end="0:21.830">秋</span><span begin="0:21.830" end="0:22.140">色</span><span begin="0:22.140" end="0:22.300">に</span><span begin="0:22.300" end="0:22.560">染</span><span begin="0:22.560" end="0:22.760">ま</span><span begin="0:22.760" end="0:22.980">る</span></p><p begin="0:22.980" end="0:24.700" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.980" end="0:23.430">いちょう</span><span begin="0:23.430" end="0:24.040">並木</span><span begin="0:24.040" end="0:24.700">歩き</span></p><p begin="0:24.840" end="0:27.560" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.840" end="0:25.110">銀</span><span begin="0:25.110" end="0:25.260">世</span><span begin="0:25.260" end="0:25.580">界</span><span begin="0:25.580" end="0:26.450">ツリーの下</span><span begin="0:26.450" end="0:26.770">笑</span><span begin="0:26.770" end="0:26.930">い</span><span begin="0:26.930" end="0:27.070">あ</span><span begin="0:27.070" end="0:27.560">い</span></p><p begin="0:27.700" end="0:30.890" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.700" end="0:28.420">嬉しい</span><span begin="0:28.420" end="0:28.700">日</span><span begin="0:28.700" end="0:29.370">も</span><span begin="0:29.370" end="0:30.100">悔しい</span><span begin="0:30.100" end="0:30.410">日</span><span begin="0:30.410" end="0:30.890">も</span></p><p begin="0:30.990" end="0:35.260" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.990" end="0:31.590">そば</span><span begin="0:31.590" end="0:31.720">で</span><span begin="0:31.720" end="0:32.007">話</span><span begin="0:32.007" end="0:33.420">聞いてたい</span><span begin="0:33.420" end="0:33.696">か</span><span begin="0:33.696" end="0:35.260">ら</span></p><p begin="0:35.520" end="0:37.700" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.520" end="0:36.700">いつまでも</span><span begin="0:36.700" end="0:37.480">あなた</span><span begin="0:37.480" end="0:37.700">と</span></p><p begin="0:37.700" end="0:41.620" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.700" end="0:38.800">ずっと</span><span begin="0:38.800" end="0:39.430">いたい</span><span begin="0:39.430" end="0:39.590">の</span><span begin="0:39.590" end="0:40.080">春</span><span begin="0:40.080" end="0:40.220">夏</span><span begin="0:40.220" end="0:40.660">秋</span><span begin="0:40.660" end="0:41.620">冬</span></p></div><div begin="0:41.920" end="1:12.120" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0:41.920" end="0:45.410" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.920" end="0:42.250">今</span><span begin="0:42.250" end="0:43.110">年</span><span begin="0:43.110" end="0:43.210">の</span><span begin="0:43.210" end="0:43.740">春</span><span begin="0:43.740" end="0:43.970">は</span><span begin="0:43.970" end="0:44.400">どこ</span><span begin="0:44.400" end="0:44.530">に</span><span begin="0:44.530" end="0:45.050">行こう</span><span begin="0:45.050" end="0:45.410">か</span></p><p begin="0:45.450" end="0:49.030" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.450" end="0:45.700">今</span><span begin="0:45.700" end="0:46.510">年</span><span begin="0:46.510" end="0:46.680">の</span><span begin="0:46.680" end="0:47.180">夏</span><span begin="0:47.180" end="0:47.420">は</span><span begin="0:47.420" end="0:47.840">どこ</span><span begin="0:47.840" end="0:47.950">に</span><span begin="0:47.950" end="0:48.450">行こう</span><span begin="0:48.450" end="0:49.030">か</span></p><p begin="0:49.200" end="0:52.380" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.200" end="0:49.730">春</span><span begin="0:49.730" end="0:49.940">の</span><span begin="0:49.940" end="0:50.580">桜</span><span begin="0:50.580" end="0:50.800">も</span><span begin="0:50.800" end="0:51.290">夏</span><span begin="0:51.290" end="0:51.580">の</span><span begin="0:51.580" end="0:51.890">海</span><span begin="0:51.890" end="0:52.380">も</span></p><p begin="0:52.470" end="0:54.070" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.470" end="0:53.110">あなた</span><span begin="0:53.110" end="0:53.499">と見た</span><span begin="0:53.499" end="0:54.070">い</span></p><p begin="0:54.190" end="0:55.710" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.190" end="0:54.840">あなた</span><span begin="0:54.840" end="0:55.132">といた</span><span begin="0:55.132" end="0:55.710">い</span></p><p begin="0:55.710" end="0:59.120" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.710" end="0:55.970">今</span><span begin="0:55.970" end="0:56.800">年</span>